{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52d9fb1df54d9a9e28cbdff0399f903e289bb9f4504d823466048e630db31c34", "ja": "星梨花、お疲れさま。衣装の試着中か。", "zh": "星梨花，辛苦了。正在试穿演出服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0164_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "42c5166f5e26cd4c23eebd72809f9fb7581730aa4f4a4ae015dfd518ad559e4f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ……どうですか？　似合ってますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿……怎么样？很适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
